Key Findings

1. NAV values show steady long-term growth across most schemes.

2. Large fund houses dominate industry AUM.

3. SIP inflows have increased consistently over time.

4. Equity-oriented categories attract the highest inflows.

5. Metro cities contribute the majority of transactions.

6. Most investors belong to middle-age groups.

7. Digital payment modes dominate transactions.

8. High-risk funds generally deliver higher long-term returns.

9. Portfolio allocations are concentrated in a few sectors.

10. Folio counts indicate growing retail participation.